# Implementation Rules (Phase 12)

Before editing: read IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md and understand why the target file exists.

## Stack
- Backend: Python 3.12+, FastAPI, Pydantic, services in backend/services/
- Frontend: Vanilla JS modules in frontend/js/ — NOT React/Next.js

## Must do
- Reuse BlockchainAPI, ApiCache, Hooks, UIStates, services — no duplicate logic
- Type Python (hints + Pydantic); JSDoc for new JS utilities
- Preserve educational simulator intent — see backend/ARCHITECTURE.md
- Minimal focused diffs; no drive-by refactors
- No TODOs or placeholder code unless explicitly requested

## Must not
- Break chain validation, balance replay, or PoW rules without documenting
- Commit secrets or data/ contents
- Rewrite unrelated files

## After significant changes
Update CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased] with: what, why, impact, risks.

## Docs
IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md · CHANGELOG.md · DEVELOPER.md · AGENTS.md
